## Goal

Build a modern automation platform that:

- supports multiple products
- supports API/UI/Hybrid E2E
- supports Azure Auth and Auth0
- minimizes dependency on Playwright
- is easy to extend
- follows SOLID and Hexagonal Architecture (Ports & Adapters)
- uses modern TypeScript

## Non Goals

- Framework tied to Playwright
- Cypress-like custom commands
- Huge BasePage
- God Objects

## Architecture Principles

1. Composition over inheritance
2. Ports & Adapters
3. Vertical Slice Architecture
4. Dependency Injection
5. Strong typing
6. Small public API